              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او آدم خیلی اجتماعی است. u âdam-e kheyli ejtemâ'i ast. He is a very sociable person."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From ejtemâ' \"gathering, society\" + -i. Masâ'el-e ejtemâ'i — social issues."
