              "text": "سالمند (sâlmand) — \"elderly; an elderly person\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پرستار هر روز به سالمندها کمک میکند. parastâr har ruz be sâlmandhâ komak mikonad. The nurse helps the elderly every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sâl \"year\" + -mand \"having\". More respectful than pir \"old\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سالمند (sâlmand) is native Persian, built from sâl \"year\" + the suffix -mand \"having\". An elderly person is rich in years."
            }
          ]
        },
